mpany is also increasing its presence in direct-to-consumer subscription models. In terms of procurement agreements, Procter & Gamble serves as a key supplier for several major retailers, ensuring compliance with specified terms and conditions [Data: Entities (160); Relationships (68, 276, 272, 191)].\n\n## Tesla, Inc.'s Role in the Agreement\n\nTesla, Inc. is a party to the procurement agreement, serving as the supplier. The company is responsible for supplying various products, including Bluetooth speakers, to entities like COSCO Shipping. Tesla's involvement in these agreements highlights its role in the global supply chain and its commitment to maintaining high standards of quality and compliance [Data: Entities (5); Relationships (5, 53, 65, 41, 44)].\n\n## Significance of Purchase, New York\n\nPurchase, New York, United States serves as a significant location for several major companies as specified in various procurement agreements. It is the designated address for Kraft Heinz, Procter & Gamble, Reckitt Benckiser, and The Coca-Cola Company. This indicates that Purchase, New York is a hub for corporate operations and agreements for these prominent entities [Data: Entities (109); Relationships (36, 60, 232)].\"\r\n\n\n-----Entities-----\nhuman_readable_id,title,description,degree\r\n151,LOTTE MART,\"Lotte Mart is a prominent retail entity focusing on expanding its presence in international markets by emphasizing regional specialty products. They are integrating Internet of Things (IoT) technology to offer personalized shopping experiences in their smart stores and are launching a private-label health and wellness product range. In addition to these initiatives, Lotte Mart is actively involved in procurement agreements, serving as the buyer for products from major companies such as Kraft Heinz and Procter & Gamble. Located at 1 Woolworths Way, Bella Vista, New South Wales, Australia, Lotte Mart is responsible for conducting inspections of the products within fiv